# In Defiant Challenge (jeuno 128), each finish once its section no longer holds (a GM's change while the event is
# open): a level 50 Warrior; 79 open, then cap 51: 79 answered 1: the available section fails, nothing (not begun);
# cap 50 again: 79, answered 1: begun. Accepted, the three items: 81 open, then the quest set back to available (its
# section 1 holds, but 81's finish is the accepted section's): nothing (not completed, the items kept, cap 50).
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/79 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/81
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=50
item ClumpOfExorayMold
item ChunkOfBombCoal
item PieceOfAncientPapyrus
login
trigger Maat                            # 79
levelcap 51                             # a GM, 79 open
finish option=1                         # cap 51: no section: nothing (not begun)
levelcap 50                             # a GM
trigger Maat                            # 79
finish option=1                         # begun
trade Maat ClumpOfExorayMold x1 ChunkOfBombCoal x1 PieceOfAncientPapyrus x1  # 81
quest Jeuno.InDefiantChallenge available  # a GM, 81 open
finish                                  # available: 81's finish is the accepted section's: nothing
